{"dog":{"age_group":"young","application_url":"https://www.nycacc.org/adopt/adoption-process/","availability_detail":"available","breed_display":"Domestic Short Hair Cross","breed_primary":"Domestic Short Hair Cross","description_text":"A volunteer writes:\nHandsome young Soccs, a grey Tabby is with us as his owner sadly lost his home. Soccs has been shy at the care center although he is not really in hiding. He appreciates a gentle approach, soft and encouraging words(he blinks)and a light touch. A shelter is not a place for Soccs and definitively, a home is in order to get him back on his feet and an understanding and patient new owner who will give him time to acclimate to a new chapter in his life. Soccs is a good cat very much missed by his former family and hoping to shine with you too! Come and meet him very soon at the Manhattan Care Center!","detail_url":"https://nycaccpets.shelterbuddy.com/animal/animalDetails.asp?s=adoption&searchTypeId=4&animalType=2%2C15&pagesize=75&task=view&tpage=21&searchType=4&animalid=210840","id":"85e09d60a1cd20c474a9e6640b4ce269","image_urls":["https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/b9fdf9815cd54cb1b2674fc47d1637c7-1795580295-1795580302-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/dcc883c35ba24abb85a7a23c59a65523-1795190612-1795190612-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/02ca14d3d79c486f9e6fc6d5b19d95b8-1795190611-1795190611-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/909b4075f3c442458b7bc2fcd0743049-1794546409-1794805149-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/918ff0868e20412d8f183217472d265c-1794805143-1794805143-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/256b875efb0c407588f9ed8ab13f648d-1794546408-1794546434-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/5ee99726006b4e39af318387d5d4786b-1794546408-1794546408-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/a8afc9e0517142b3af1b47450e1332eb-1794090332-